 *
 * OUTPUT / WRITEBACK FIELDS
 * - Homework Completions → Upload Status, Upload Error, Uploaded At, Writeback Complete?
 * - Video Feedback → existing Upload Status, Video URL or Drive Link (Reviewer/Lambda only),
 *   Video Asset File Name, Video Asset Uploaded At, Upload Error (includes repair notes),
